menu "ButterBot"

	config BB_STOCK_VOICE
		bool "Stock on-device voice (flite)"
		default n
		help
			Speak stock phrases with the built-in flite synthesizer (about 4.5 MB of the app).
			Off: the server speaks them in the companion personality's voice, and they are
			silent while it can't be reached. Turn on and app-flash to bring the stock voice back.

endmenu
